### Peticiones de ejemplo (extensión "REST Client" de VS Code o cliente HTTP de IntelliJ)
@api = http://localhost:3200

### Crear pedido -> 201
POST {{api}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pedido-123

{
  "customer_id": "12345678-5",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "SKU-1", "quantity": 2, "unit_price": 8990 },
    { "sku": "SKU-2", "quantity": 1, "unit_price": 3990 }
  ]
}

### Repetir con la misma clave -> 200 con el mismo pedido
POST {{api}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pedido-123

{
  "customer_id": "12345678-5",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "SKU-1", "quantity": 2, "unit_price": 8990 },
    { "sku": "SKU-2", "quantity": 1, "unit_price": 3990 }
  ]
}

### Datos inválidos -> 400 ORDER_INVALID_QUANTITY
POST {{api}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customer_id": "12345678-5", "items": [ { "sku": "SKU-1", "quantity": 0, "unit_price": 8990 } ] }

### Consultar (reemplaza el id)
GET {{api}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Salud y métricas
GET {{api}}/ready

###
GET {{api}}/metrics

###
GET http://localhost:3201/metrics

### Cambiar el estado (reemplaza el id): listo_para_despacho -> en_transito
PATCH {{api}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "en_transito" }

### Cambio no permitido -> 409 ORDER_INVALID_TRANSITION
PATCH {{api}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "en_preparacion" }

### RUT inválido -> 400 ORDER_INVALID_CUSTOMER
POST {{api}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customer_id": "12345678-9", "items": [ { "sku": "SKU-1", "quantity": 1, "unit_price": 8990 } ] }
